{% doc %}
  @prompt
    4 gleich breite Spalten nebeneinander (1–4)
    
    Jede Spalte zeigt:
    • Ein Icon oder Symbolbild (Upload im Editor möglich, quadratisch ca. 80–100 px)
    • Einen Titel (z. B. „Schritt 1: Zellschutz aktivieren“)
    • Einen kurzen Beschreibungstext (1–2 Sätze)
    
    Zwischen den Spalten dezente Trennlinien oder Abstände (ca. 32 px)
    
    Die Section soll vollbreit sein, aber mit max. 1200 px Content-Breite und gleichmäßigem Padding links/rechts
    
    Layout Mobile:
    
    Schritte untereinander anzeigen (Stacked Layout)
    
    Icons mittig über Titel
    
    Text jeweils darunter
    
    Einheitliche Abstände (Padding 20–24 px, Margin zwischen Steps 16–20 px)
    
    Design-Anforderungen:
    
    Moderner, cleaner Stil (z. B. wie Shopify „Dawn“)
    
    Einheitliche Typografie, Icons mit object-fit: contain
    
    Option für hellen oder dunklen Hintergrund
    
    Animation beim Scrollen (Fade-in oder Slide-up) optional
    
    Editor-Felder (Schema):
    
    Section-Überschrift (z. B. „Was passiert in deinem Körper mit VitaminH2“)
    
    Wiederholbare Blöcke (4):
    • icon → Bild-Upload (PNG/SVG)
    • title → Textfeld
    • description → Kurzbeschreibung (Textarea)
    
    Technische Anforderungen:
    
    Verwende image_picker für Icons
    
    Nutze Flexbox oder CSS Grid (grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr))
    
    Responsiv: automatisches Stacken bei < 768 px
    
    Sicherstellen, dass Bilder immer angezeigt werden (Fallback-Icon, wenn leer)
    
    Akzeptanzkriterien:
    
    Auf Desktop sind 4 Schritte horizontal sichtbar
    
    Auf Mobile werden die Schritte klar untereinander angezeigt
    
    Alle Inhalte (Titel, Texte, Icons) sind im Editor anpassbar
    
    Keine Inhalte am Rand abgeschnitten, es soll keine trennwände angezeigt werden und füge am schluss noch einen cta button um mehr zu lesen. ich möchte die volle möglichkeit haben alles anzupassen
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-steps-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-steps-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-steps-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 48px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
  }

  .ai-steps-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .ai-step-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-step-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-step-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-step-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.placeholder_bg }};
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-step-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  .ai-step-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-steps-cta-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .ai-steps-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font_weight }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    border: {{ block.settings.button_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.button_text_transform }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.button_letter_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-steps-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_hover_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_hover_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.button_border_hover_color }};
    transform: translateY({{ block.settings.button_hover_lift }}px);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-steps-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
    .ai-steps-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 32px 20px;
    }

    .ai-steps-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-steps-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .ai-step-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.icon_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.icon_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .ai-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-step-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-steps-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-steps-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-steps-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.section_heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-steps-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_heading }}</h2>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-steps-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% for i in (1..4) %}
        {% liquid
          assign icon_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_icon'
          assign title_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_title'
          assign description_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_description'
          
          assign step_icon = block.settings[icon_key]
          assign step_title = block.settings[title_key]
          assign step_description = block.settings[description_key]
        %}

        <div class="ai-step-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-step-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if step_icon != blank %}
              <img
                src="{{ step_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                alt="{{ step_title | escape }}"
                class="ai-step-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="200"
                height="200"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-step-icon-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          {% if step_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}

          {% if step_description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-step-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.show_cta_button %}
      <div class="ai-steps-cta-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.cta_button_link }}"
          class="ai-steps-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.cta_button_text }}
        </a>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

